  "question": {
    "text": "At STP, a container has 1 mole of Ar, 2 moles of  <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , 3 moles of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  and 4 moles of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  without changing the total pressure if one mole of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>  is removed, the partial pressure of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "is changed by about 26%",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "is halved",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "is unchanged",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "changes by 30%",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "In the first case,<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> <br/><br/>So total number of moles  <math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> <br/><br/>If P in the total pressure,  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>In the second case,<br/><br/> <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math> <br/><br/>As P remains the same,  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>So decrease in partial pressure of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> <br/><br/>So % decrease in partial pressure of  <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> <br/><br/> <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>90</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>100</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>700</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>27</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>26</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math>"
  }
